{"title":"UX Designer Roadmap","role":"UX Designer","summary":"You do not need to become a full-stack developer, but understanding engineering constraints makes design decisions more practical.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design) – UI/UX & Interaction Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"UX Design Intern / Junior UX Designer"}],[{"text":"1–3 Years"},{"text":"UX Designer / Product Designer"}],[{"text":"3–6 Years"},{"text":"Senior UX Designer"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Lead UX / Senior Product Designer"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Design Manager / Principal Designer"}],[{"text":"12+ Years"},{"text":"Head of Design"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Design Director / VP Design"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals before becoming tool-dependent."},{"type":"h","text":"Core Subjects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Visual composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Human-centred design"},{"text":"Design history"},{"text":"Psychology of perception"},{"text":"Introduction to interaction design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UX Foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User needs"},{"text":"User personas"},{"text":"User journeys"},{"text":"Problem definition"},{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"Information architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"FigJam"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Presentation tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Output"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2–3 small UX case studies"},{"text":"Mobile app redesign"},{"text":"Website usability critique"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — UX Research & Interaction Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to understand users before designing solutions."},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Contextual inquiry"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"User personas"},{"text":"Empathy mapping"},{"text":"Journey mapping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interaction Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Navigation systems"},{"text":"Interaction patterns"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Micro-interactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Redesign a complicated university/student portal"},{"type":"h","text":"Document:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Problems","User Flow","Wireframes","Prototype","Testing","Iteration"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Product UX & Design Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from individual screens to complete products."},{"type":"h","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Responsive interfaces"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Design tokens"},{"text":"Interaction patterns"},{"text":"Product thinking"},{"text":"UX writing"},{"text":"Usability metrics"},{"text":"A/B testing fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Understanding"},{"type":"h","text":"A UX Designer should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript fundamentals"},{"text":"Responsive web design"},{"text":"Mobile app architecture basics"},{"text":"APIs at a conceptual level"},{"text":"Frontend development workflow"}]},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to become a full-stack developer, but understanding engineering constraints makes design decisions more practical."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Product Strategy & Professional Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Develop senior-level foundations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Design strategy"},{"text":"Business goals"},{"text":"User metrics"},{"text":"Conversion funnels"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Design critique"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Design handoff"},{"text":"Design documentation"},{"text":"Accessibility standards"},{"text":"Ethical design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Build an end-to-end digital product:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted student career-planning platform"},{"type":"h","text":"Include:"},{"type":"flow","items":["User research","Problem statement","Personas","Journey map","IA","Wireframes","High-fidelity UI","Prototype","Usability testing","Design system","Developer handoff"]},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Track"},{"type":"table","header":["Year","Core Focus","Portfolio Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"1"},{"text":"Design + UX foundations"},{"text":"3 UX projects"}],[{"text":"2"},{"text":"Research + interaction"},{"text":"2 detailed case studies"}],[{"text":"3"},{"text":"Product UX + design systems"},{"text":"Complete product system"}],[{"text":"4"},{"text":"Strategy + professional practice"},{"text":"Capstone product"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"h","text":"A UX Designer can specialise in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Design"},{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"UI Design"},{"text":"Design Systems"},{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Information Architecture"},{"text":"UX Writing / Content Design"},{"text":"Accessibility Design"},{"text":"Mobile UX"},{"text":"Enterprise UX"},{"text":"Conversational UX"},{"text":"AI Product Design"},{"text":"AR/VR Interaction Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Core Soft Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Empathy"},{"text":"Critical thinking"},{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Collaboration"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Receiving and giving critique"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships should involve real product work, not only graphic-design tasks."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX Design Intern"},{"text":"Product Design Intern"},{"text":"UI/UX Design Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"Interaction Design Intern"},{"text":"Design Systems Intern"},{"text":"Service Design Intern"},{"text":"Product Design Research Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Good Project Environments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS products"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Consumer apps"},{"text":"Enterprise software"},{"text":"AI products"},{"text":"Mobility products"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Requirement"},{"type":"h","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"p","text":"4–6 strong case studies rather than 15–20 superficial designs."},{"type":"h","text":"Each case study should demonstrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Research","Insight","Design","Testing","Iteration","Outcome"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certifications are secondary to portfolio quality, but useful learning areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX Research"},{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Design Thinking"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Usability Testing"},{"text":"Design Systems"},{"text":"Product Management fundamentals"},{"text":"Google Analytics/product analytics fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"FigJam"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Prototyping tools"},{"text":"Notion"},{"text":"Jira"},{"text":"Confluence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Optional:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Framer"},{"text":"Webflow"},{"text":"Principle"},{"text":"ProtoPie"},{"text":"After Effects"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX Design Intern"},{"text":"Junior UX Designer"},{"text":"Junior Product Designer"},{"text":"UI/UX Designer"},{"text":"Interaction Design Associate"},{"text":"UX Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mid-Level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UX Designer"},{"text":"Product Designer"},{"text":"Interaction Designer"},{"text":"UX Researcher"},{"text":"Service Designer"},{"text":"Design Systems Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Senior"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior UX Designer"},{"text":"Senior Product Designer"},{"text":"Lead Interaction Designer"},{"text":"Senior UX Researcher"},{"text":"Design Systems Lead"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Manager"},{"text":"Principal Product Designer"},{"text":"Principal UX Designer"},{"text":"Head of UX"},{"text":"Head of Product Design"},{"text":"Design Director"},{"text":"VP Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers Usually Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Scenario"},{"type":"note","label":"Problem","text":"Users abandon an online checkout process before payment."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong UX Designer should not immediately redesign the screen."},{"type":"h","text":"The process should be:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Review available analytics."},{"text":"Identify the highest-drop-off step."},{"text":"Review existing user feedback."},{"text":"Interview users where possible."},{"text":"Identify usability problems."},{"text":"Map the current user journey."},{"text":"Generate design hypotheses."},{"text":"Create alternative flows."},{"text":"Prototype."},{"text":"Conduct usability testing."},{"text":"Iterate."},{"text":"Measure the effect after implementation."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Topics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the difference between UX and UI?"},{"text":"How do you conduct user research?"},{"text":"What is information architecture?"},{"text":"How do you create a user journey?"},{"text":"What makes a good usability test?"},{"text":"How do you handle conflicting stakeholder feedback?"},{"text":"What is a design system?"},{"text":"How do you design for accessibility?"},{"text":"How do you measure whether a UX improvement worked?"},{"text":"Explain one of your portfolio projects from problem to outcome."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Design Workflow"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional UX workflow can be structured as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Discover"},{"type":"h","text":"Define"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Synthesize"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideate"},{"type":"h","text":"Information Architecture"},{"type":"h","text":"Wireframe"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype"},{"type":"h","text":"Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Iterate"},{"type":"h","text":"Handoff"},{"type":"h","text":"Measure"},{"type":"p","text":"The important distinction is that UX is not simply making attractive screens. The designer must demonstrate why the design solves a user and business problem."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not required for most UX Designer jobs if the candidate has a strong B.Des portfolio and relevant experience."},{"type":"p","text":"However, postgraduate study can be useful for research, academia, specialised interaction design, or leadership."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Options"},{"type":"table","header":["PG Programme","Best For"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Des Interaction Design"},{"text":"Advanced interaction design"}],[{"text":"M.Des UX Design"},{"text":"UX/product design"}],[{"text":"M.Des HCI"},{"text":"Human-computer interaction"}],[{"text":"M.Des Service Design"},{"text":"Service/customer experience"}],[{"text":"M.Des Design Management"},{"text":"Design leadership"}],[{"text":"MSc HCI"},{"text":"Research + technology"}],[{"text":"MA Interaction Design"},{"text":"Interaction/design research"}],[{"text":"MBA Product Management"},{"text":"Product leadership"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"For most industry candidates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Strong B.Des","excellent portfolio","internship","product experience"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"can be more valuable than immediately pursuing another degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Relevant destinations include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Sweden"},{"text":"Finland"},{"text":"Denmark"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant Master's Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"User Experience Design"},{"text":"Product Design"},{"text":"Service Design"},{"text":"Information Experience Design"},{"text":"Design Research"},{"text":"Digital Experience Design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Strong international programmes often combine design with psychology, computing, research and emerging technologies."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A standard industry pathway:"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des UI/UX & Interaction Design"},{"type":"h","text":"UX/Product Design Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior UX Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Designer / Product Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior UX Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead / Principal Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Manager / Principal Product Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of UX / Product Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Director / VP Design"},{"type":"h","text":"An alternative research pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","UX Research Internship","UX Researcher","Senior UX Researcher","Research Lead","Head of Research"]},{"type":"h","text":"Research Opportunities"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-computer interaction"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Behavioural design"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Conversational interfaces"},{"text":"Trust in AI"},{"text":"Explainable AI interfaces"},{"text":"Digital wellbeing"},{"text":"Inclusive design"},{"text":"Voice interfaces"},{"text":"Multimodal interaction"},{"text":"AR/VR interfaces"},{"text":"Wearable interfaces"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Research"},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly important future field is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Human–AI Interaction (HAI)"},{"type":"p","text":"Designers will increasingly need to determine how users understand, control, trust, correct and collaborate with AI systems."},{"type":"h","text":"Future Skills — 2030+"},{"type":"h","text":"UX design is moving toward:"},{"type":"flow","items":["UX","Product","AI","Behaviour","Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Important future skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI product design"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Conversational UX"},{"text":"Multimodal interfaces"},{"text":"AI-assisted prototyping"},{"text":"Design-to-code workflows"},{"text":"Product analytics"},{"text":"Behavioural analytics"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Responsible design"},{"text":"Privacy-aware design"},{"text":"Personalised interfaces"},{"text":"Spatial computing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI will automate portions of wireframing and visual production, but problem framing, user research, judgement, product strategy and understanding human behaviour remain important differentiators."},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Outlook"},{"type":"h","text":"The role may increasingly evolve from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Screen Designer","Experience Designer","Human-AI Experience Architect"]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Experience Designer"},{"text":"Human-AI Interaction Designer"},{"text":"Conversational UX Designer"},{"text":"Spatial Experience Designer"},{"text":"AI Product Designer"},{"text":"Behavioural Experience Designer"},{"text":"Design Systems Architect"},{"text":"Digital Experience Strategist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"UX"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Personas"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Wireframing"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"UI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Typography"},{"text":"Layout"},{"text":"Colour"},{"text":"Visual hierarchy"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Components"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Figma"},{"text":"HTML/CSS"},{"text":"JavaScript fundamentals"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Design-to-development handoff"},{"text":"Product analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User metrics"},{"text":"Business goals"},{"text":"Product discovery"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"A/B testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Design critique"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Collaboration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"AI product design"},{"text":"Conversational UX"},{"text":"Spatial computing"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Responsible design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des UI/UX & Interaction Design","UX/Product Design Internship","Junior UX Designer","UX Designer/Product Designer","Senior UX Designer","Lead/Principal Designer","Design Manager/Head of UX","Design Director"]},{"type":"note","label":"Best strategic priority","text":"build 4–6 deep UX case studies showing research, reasoning, prototyping, usability testing and measurable outcomes. A polished Figma portfolio alone is not enough; employers increasingly evaluate the quality of the design process and product thinking behind the screens."}]}]}